{"title": "Stone Tablets", "pageid": 53499, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Stone_Tablets", "categories": ["Containers", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_Row_Multiple_A_Faded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_Row_Multiple_A_Faded.webp/300px-DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_Row_Multiple_A_Faded.webp, /w/images/7/7c/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_Row_Multiple_A_Faded.webp 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stone Tablets image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_Row_Multiple_A_Faded.webp/300px-DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_Row_Multiple_A_Faded.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_Row_Multiple_A_Faded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Stone Tablets</b> is a static clutter container that cannot be picked up or moved. Usually empty or containing various <a href=\"/wiki/Books\" title=\"Books\">books</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Scrolls\" title=\"Scrolls\">scrolls</a>.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Containers\" title=\"Containers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/25px-Containers_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/38px-Containers_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Containers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/25px-Containers_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Containers\" title=\"Containers\">Containers</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Throughout the game as set-dressing and random loot, a large cluster of them in the <a href=\"/wiki/Enclave_Library\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enclave Library\">Enclave Library</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203248\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 688/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4480/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2094/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 17/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 sec